{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12374","headline":"山下别杜少府 · 钱起","name":"山下别杜少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"把手意难尽，前山日渐低。\n情人那忍别，宿鸟尚同栖。\n寸晷恋言笑，佳期欲阻暌。\n离云愁出岫，去水咽分溪。\n庄叟几虚说，杨朱空自迷。\n伤心独归路，秋草更萋萋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}